This licence covers the code in code/ and reddit/ and the page scripts. The text
of the page, the figures and the derived data files in data/ are released under
CC BY 4.0, with one exception: pictures and summaries derived from WorldClim 2.1
(Fick and Hijmans 2017) are shared for research and non-commercial use under the
WorldClim terms. The WorldClim grids are not redistributed: the page shows them
only as palette images in colour classes (data/page/vis_*.png) and reads values
from a 0.5 degree summary rounded to 0.5 m/s (data/page/sum_*.png). NCEP/NCAR Reanalysis 1
data are public domain (NOAA PSL). Wind farms derive from the WRI Global Power
Plant Database v1.3 (CC BY 4.0). Outlines: Natural Earth (public domain) and
Office for National Statistics boundaries (Open Government Licence v3).
